  "contentHtml": "<p>교과특색활동으로 2시간이 주어져서&#160;</p><p>유해물질ZERO 상큼천연치약만들기 활동을 진행해보았습니다.</p><p>&#160;</p><p>--- 아래는 제 블로그에 있는 것을 그대로 복붙해서 말이 짧습니다.---</p><p>&#160;</p><p><span style=\"color: #000000;\">5,6교시 2시간에 걸쳐 진행</span></p><p><span style=\"color: #000000;\">매년 하는 거지만 그때마다 무슨 주제로 할지, 어떤 단원과 관련지어 조금이라도 더 의미있는 활동을 할지 매번 고민되는데 이번에는 환경과 유해물질 관련하여 얘기해보고 식품 첨가물의 유해성에 대해서도 살짝 언급하고(요즘 생리통이 심한 아이들이 많다. 이것도 어쩌면 장기와 피부를 통해 흡수되는 유해물질이 원인이 될 수도...), 입 속으로 들어오는 미세플라스틱, 화장품과 세안제 사용, 노푸, 제로 웨이스트 등 연관지어 설명하자만 끝이 없지만 영상을 보면서 살짝 언급해줬다. 지루하면 오히려 역효과!</span></p><p>&#160;</p><p><span style=\"color: #000000;\">이찌되었든 오늘의 주제는 유해성분 ZERO 상큼천연치약 만들기</span></p><p>&#160;</p><p><span style=\"color: #000000;\">1. 영상보고 사용되는 재료의 특징과 방법 간단히 적어보기</span></p><p><a href=\"https://youtu.be/10gNooYuRcw\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://youtu.be/10gNooYuRcw</a></p><div class=\"figure-video\" data-ke-type=\"video\" data-video-url=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=10gNooYuRcw&amp;feature=youtu.be\" data-video-host=\"youtube\" data-video-play-service=\"daum_cafe\" data-video-width=\"851\" data-video-height=\"479\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-video-thumbnail=\"https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/bbxMpV/hyJ9SCWSt5/PeKN52hqBrJ6VgExazoXP1/img.jpg?width=1280&amp;height=720&amp;face=270_146_430_320\" data-ke-mobile-mobilestyle=\"widthContent\" data-video-origin-width=\"851\" data-video-origin-height=\"479\"><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/10gNooYuRcw\" width=\"851\" height=\"479\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" allowfullscreen=\"\"></iframe><div class=\"figcaption\"></div></div><p><span style=\"color: #000000;\">2. 치약 만들기</span></p><p><span style=\"color: #000000;\">예쁘게 스티커도 미리 만들어놓고 출력하여 나눠줌</span></p><p>&#160;</p><p><span style=\"color: #000000;\">3. 마지막으로 오늘 만든 치약 홍보하는 전단지 만들기로 마무리</span></p><div class=\"imagegridblock\" data-ke-type=\"imageGrid\"><div class=\"image-container\"><span data-url=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/d81fa19746901122af47f3551b561d87bfa3c072\" data-origin-width=\"740\" data-origin-height=\"740\" style=\"width:49.37%; margin-right: 10px;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/d81fa19746901122af47f3551b561d87bfa3c072\" class=\"txc-image-grid\"></span><span data-url=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/c6d1aa0fa9f788136151ebef0a3993feb69fa51f\" data-origin-width=\"740\" data-origin-height=\"740\" style=\"width:49.37%; \"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/c6d1aa0fa9f788136151ebef0a3993feb69fa51f\" class=\"txc-image-grid\"></span></div></div><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><div class=\"imagegridblock\" data-ke-type=\"imageGrid\"><div class=\"image-container\"><span data-url=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/67be65793a81e4068c37972e84dfee968570c9b6\" data-origin-width=\"740\" data-origin-height=\"740\" style=\"width:49.37%; margin-right: 10px;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/67be65793a81e4068c37972e84dfee968570c9b6\" class=\"txc-image-grid\"></span><span data-url=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/07bb715b29ec21d57e21a67378d661d5f69ab7d1\" data-origin-width=\"740\" data-origin-height=\"740\" style=\"width:49.37%; \"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/07bb715b29ec21d57e21a67378d661d5f69ab7d1\" class=\"txc-image-grid\"></span></div></div><p>&#160;</p><div class=\"imagegridblock\" data-ke-type=\"imageGrid\"><div class=\"image-container\"><span data-url=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/a7e889003366bfff7c7ae5c97fcc631a415dd5f2\" data-origin-width=\"740\" data-origin-height=\"532\" style=\"width:57.44%; margin-right: 10px;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/a7e889003366bfff7c7ae5c97fcc631a415dd5f2\" class=\"txc-image-grid\"></span><span data-url=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/8978897143a891eaf68040612eb3afa9b8395ae0\" data-origin-width=\"740\" data-origin-height=\"740\" style=\"width:41.30%; \"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/8978897143a891eaf68040612eb3afa9b8395ae0\" class=\"txc-image-grid\"></span></div></div><p><span style=\"color: #000000;\">아이들이 모두 집중해서 잘 듣고 재미있게 참여해줘서 고맙다.</span></p><p><span style=\"color: #000000;\">끝까지 뒷정리도 잘 해 줌!</span></p><p>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-file\" data-ke-type=\"file\" data-file-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/0ef1722561c820884dd5d4588fccd37043a15dc7?download\" data-file-name=\"라벨.hwp\" data-file-size=\"1374720\" data-mimetype=\"application/haansofthwp\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3D424t%26dataid%3D228%26fileid%3D8%26regdt%3D20210511104543&url=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafeattach%2F1TaBA%2F0ef1722561c820884dd5d4588fccd37043a15dc7')\"><div class=\"image\"></div><div class=\"desc\"><div class=\"filename\"><span class=\"name\">라벨</span><span class=\"type\">.hwp</span></div><div class=\"size\">1.31MB</div></div></a></div><div class=\"figure-file\" data-ke-type=\"file\" data-file-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/0bd1ec58d0ec535a98682a482c8157cb0a1f20bc?download\" data-file-name=\"상콤천연치약만들기.hwp\" data-file-size=\"236544\" data-mimetype=\"application/haansofthwp\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3D424t%26dataid%3D228%26fileid%3D7%26regdt%3D20210511104543&url=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafeattach%2F1TaBA%2F0bd1ec58d0ec535a98682a482c8157cb0a1f20bc')\"><div class=\"image\"></div><div class=\"desc\"><div class=\"filename\"><span class=\"name\">상콤천연치약만들기</span><span class=\"type\">.hwp</span></div><div class=\"size\">231.00KB</div></div></a></div>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
